{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:e789d7addc29da1c","name":"Unarmed Attacks","source":{"id":"source:reference-e789d7addc29da1c","title":"Unarmed Attacks","revision":24978,"timestamp":"2024-11-10T16:36:53Z","sha256":"217f4c022e66d80b7cfda82789b55d6abbe487cd787ebce91f79fec032e3b06f","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=24978","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Unarmed%20Attacks&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-e789d7addc29da1c","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Books: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Core Rulebook"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_Rulebook"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Threats of the Galaxy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Threats_of_the_Galaxy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Striking for damage with punches, kicks, and headbutts is essentially a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Melee Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Melee_Attack"}," with a weapon. Unarmed Attacks deal normal Bludgeoning damage.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A Medium creature normally deals 1d4 points of Bludgeoning damage (plus ",{"tag":"a","children":["Strength"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Strength"}," modifier) with a successful Unarmed Attack; a Small creature deals 1d3 points of Bludgeoning damage (plus ",{"tag":"a","children":["Strength"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Strength"}," modifier); a Large creature deals 1d6 points of Bludgeoning damage (plus ",{"tag":"a","children":["Strength"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Strength"}," modifier). Certain ",{"tag":"a","children":["Talents"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Talents","referenceId":"reference:e8871b70ebfa07d9"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Feats"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Feats","referenceId":"reference:9194ccf56b9cace0"},", or special abilities may increase the damage a character deals with their Unarmed Attacks.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["For the purpose of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Feats"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Feats","referenceId":"reference:9194ccf56b9cace0"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Talents"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Talents","referenceId":"reference:e8871b70ebfa07d9"}," that allow you to select a weapon group for that ability to apply to, Unarmed Attacks are ",{"tag":"a","children":["Simple Weapons"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Simple_Weapons"},". However, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Combat Gloves"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Combat_Gloves","referenceId":"reference:2bd4897a780f381e"}," provide a martial artist with a damage advantage that lets them make use of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Talents"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Talents","referenceId":"reference:e8871b70ebfa07d9"}," such as ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Weapon Specialization (Simple Weapons)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Weapon_Specialization_(Simple_Weapons)"}]},", further increasing their aptitude for Unarmed Attacks.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Combat Gloves"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Combat_Gloves","referenceId":"reference:2bd4897a780f381e"}," are considered ",{"tag":"a","children":["Simple Weapons (Melee)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Simple_Weapons_(Melee)","referenceId":"reference:cd7a4aafaae07eb3"},", but attacks with ",{"tag":"a","children":["Combat Gloves"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Combat_Gloves","referenceId":"reference:2bd4897a780f381e"}," are still considered to be Unarmed Attacks.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Jedi Counseling"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Web Enhancements"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Web_Enhancements"}," (",{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi Counseling"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi_Counseling"},")"]},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Unarmed Weapon Group"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Q:"]}," What ",{"tag":"a","children":["Weapon Group"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Weapon_Group"}," includes Unarmed Attacks? How about Natural Weapons? In most places, it seems like they're ",{"tag":"a","children":["Simple Weapons"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Simple_Weapons"},", but ",{"tag":"a","children":["Weapon Focus"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Weapon_Focus","referenceId":"reference:393613c18e211d0f"}," refers to Unarmed Attacks as if they are separate.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["A:"]}," Unarmed Attacks and Natural Weapons are considered ",{"tag":"a","children":["Simple Weapons"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Simple_Weapons"}," in which all characters are proficient. The reference to Unarmed Attacks in the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Weapon Focus"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Weapon_Focus","referenceId":"reference:393613c18e211d0f"}," Feat is an error.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Unarmed Attacks and Weapon Finesse"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Q:"]}," Do Unarmed Attacks and Natural Weapons benefit from the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Weapon Finesse"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Weapon_Finesse","referenceId":"reference:7752dd7b768faff2"}," Feat?\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["A:"]}," Yes. Unarmed Attacks and Natural Weapons are ",{"tag":"a","children":["Light Melee Weapons"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Light_Melee_Weapons"},".\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
